t hand corner of the page. <A href=\"http://www.elections.ri.gov/\" target=\"_blank\">Click \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\there</A> for more information about the Rhode Island Board of Elections.</SPAN></FONT></B></SPAN></P>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<P class=\"MsoNormal\"><SPAN class=\"frmh21\"><B><FONT face=\"Arial\" color=\"navy\" size=\"4\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">Filings</SPAN></FONT></B></SPAN></P>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<P class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.5in\"><FONT face=\"Arial\" size=\"4\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">The \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFilings tab contains the filing history for an organization. It also includes \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tan overview of the organization’s loans and Matching Public Funds (MPF) \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\trequests. After you choose an organization, the filing history, loan history, \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tand MPF history will be displayed. You will be able to view the filings, both \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tscanned and electronic, or drill-down into the loan information.</SPAN></FONT></P>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<P class=\"MsoNormal\"><SPAN class=\"frmh21\"><B><FONT face=\"Arial\" color=\"navy\" size=\"4\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">Contributions</SPAN></FONT></B></SPAN></P>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<P class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 0.5in\"><FONT face=\"Arial\" size=\"4\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">The \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tContributions tab allows you to run ad-hoc reports on contributions filed on \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSummary of Campaign Activity (CF-2) or on Affidavit and Payment Request – \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMatching Public Funds (MPF-3) reports. The reports allow a certain degree of \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcustomization in that you are able to specify certain filters to limit what \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tappears on the reports.</SPAN></FONT></P>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<P class=\"MsoNormal\"><SPAN class=\"frmh21\"><B><FONT face=\"Arial\